# Copy this file to .env.local and fill in your key.
# The Anthropic API key is used server-side only, by src/app/api/chat/route.ts —
# it is never exposed to the browser.
ANTHROPIC_API_KEY=sk-ant-...

# Optional — defaults to claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929 if unset.
# ANTHROPIC_MODEL=claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929

# The ElevenLabs API key narrates each brew step aloud, server-side only, by
# src/app/api/narrate/route.ts — it is never exposed to the browser. Get one
# at https://elevenlabs.io. Narration just stays silent if this is unset.
ELEVENLABS_API_KEY=

# Optional — defaults to the Singaporean "Gabriel — Calm and Peaceful Narrator"
# voice (sla02gCKN0hNfNn9ORJN), a library voice that needs a Creator plan or
# above. On the free tier, use a premade voice such as "Lily":
# ELEVENLABS_VOICE_ID=pFZP5JQG7iQjIQuC4Bku
